{{- /*
  The `badtwin` format's producer, wired only by the `unpublished` environment.

  It publishes for EVERY page, unconditionally. The fault this format exists to
  exercise is not in the producer but in its hook, which answers with text
  instead of a boolean: every one of these URLs is written, so every one of them
  has to survive an answer the module refuses.
*/ -}}
BADTWIN {{ .Title }}
